    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Orchestration and data",
      "items": [
        "The Web UI calls the API; the server starts a worker subprocess.",
        "The worker passes results between stages and saves JSON after each stage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Shared LLM access across all 4 stages",
      "items": [
        "llm/client.py and governor.py manage providers and quotas.",
        "Each stage has its own profile; the synthesis edge illustrates shared access."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Local storage and additional sources",
      "items": [
        "Extraction, synthesis, and draft caches are stored on local disk.",
        "Retrieval also calls arXiv; optional citation expansion uses Semantic Scholar."
      ]
